   uncontrolled approximation.
3. [NOTE - fragility] the benchmark sits across the first bound-state
   threshold (b = 1.52-2.09 over alpha 0.008-0.011): sigma/m(200) swings
   19-129 cm^2/g -- the phenomenology is resonance-fragile.
4. [CONTEXT] the DT-1 (5.71 GeV) candidate was already demoted to
